\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Simulated Trades: The trades made on the platform are simulated and do not involve real assets or real money. Users cannot withdraw, transfer, or exchange simulated funds for real currency or assets.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Educational Focus: The platform is designed exclusively for educational purposes. You acknowledge that FundedHero is not offering investment services, trading advice, or financial products of any kind.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Real vs. Simulated Trades: All results within the simulated environment are hypothetical and should not be considered indicative of future financial outcomes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2.2 Intended Use of the Platform<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The platform is intended solely for educational purposes to allow users to practice trading, develop strategies, and improve trading skills in a risk-free environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Learning and Skill Development: The platform should not be used for any commercial purposes, real-world investment decisions, or trading on actual financial markets. Any real-world decisions made based on simulated trading experience are at the user\u2019s own risk.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Non-Commercial Use: You agree that you will not use the platform for any commercial purposes, such as engaging in financial trading on behalf of others, or offering paid advice or services. The platform is intended for individual learning only.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2.3 Simulated Funds and No Financial Risk<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The funds used in the platform are entirely simulated and have no real-world value. These funds are provided to users to create a realistic trading environment but are not redeemable for actual money.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>No Withdrawal or Transfer: Users may not withdraw, transfer, or exchange simulated funds for real-world financial gain.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fictional Nature of Simulated Trades: Any profit or loss experienced in the simulated trading environment is purely hypothetical. FundedHero does not guarantee that the trading conditions simulated on the platform will be representative of actual market conditions.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2.4 Educational Nature and No Financial Advisory Role<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You agree that the platform is not a financial service or trading advisor. Any information, data, or tools provided by FundedHero are intended to assist with learning and developing trading strategies only. FundedHero does not provide personalized financial advice, nor does it manage real funds or investments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>No Financial Advice: The content available on the platform, including any trading strategies, tutorials, or simulated data, is not financial advice and should not be used as a basis for real-world trading decisions.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>3. Simulated Funds and Eligibility for Real Payouts<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3.1 Simulated Funds Overview<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The platform provides users with simulated funds, which are virtual and have no real-world value. These funds are used exclusively for educational purposes, allowing users to trade and experience the dynamics of financial markets in a risk-free environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Fictitious Profits and Losses: Any profits or losses made within the simulated environment are entirely fictional. They cannot be used to make any real-world financial decisions.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>No Exchange for Real Money: Simulated funds cannot be converted into real currency, nor can they be transferred to real-world trading platforms.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3.2 Eligibility for Real Payouts<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Under certain promotional programs or challenges, users who demonstrate outstanding performance using simulated funds may become eligible for real-world payouts or rewards. Payout eligibility is determined based on the performance of the user in the simulated environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Performance Metrics: Eligibility for payouts will be based on clearly defined criteria such as profitability, adherence to risk management guidelines, and overall simulated performance.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Payout Discretion: Payouts are entirely discretionary and are not guaranteed. Even if you meet the eligibility criteria, FundedHero reserves the right to withhold, modify, or deny any payout at its sole discretion.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3.3 Discretionary Nature of Payouts<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FundedHero has full discretion to determine whether payouts will be issued. Payouts may be adjusted or denied for reasons including but not limited to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Failure to meet the specific performance criteria set by FundedHero.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Violations of the platform\u2019s rules or ethical guidelines.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Evidence of manipulation or fraudulent behavior in the simulated environment.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3.4 Verification of Payout Eligibility<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All payout eligibility is subject to verification by FundedHero. We will review users\u2019 performance to ensure compliance with the platform\u2019s guidelines. This may include a detailed audit of trades, strategies, and risk management practices.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Discretionary Review: Even if a user qualifies based on the criteria, FundedHero reserves the right to review and verify the performance before releasing any payouts.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Failure to Comply: Users who fail to meet all guidelines and criteria may forfeit their eligibility for any real payouts.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">3.5 Payout Processing and Payment Methods<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the event of an approved payout, funds will be processed using the payment method selected by FundedHero. Payment methods may include, but are not limited to, PayPal, bank transfer, or other authorized payment processors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Payment Processing Times: Payouts will be processed within [7] business days after verification, but users acknowledge that delays may occur due to technical, legal, or financial constraints.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Associated Fees: Users are responsible for any fees associated with receiving payouts, including transaction fees, currency conversion fees, and taxes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>4. User Responsibilities, Account Conduct, and Compliance<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">4.1 Account Creation and Security<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To use the platform, you must create an account by providing accurate and complete personal information. You agree to maintain the confidentiality of your account credentials, including your username and password, and are responsible for all activities under your account.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>User Account Responsibility: You are solely responsible for any actions that occur under your account and agree to immediately notify FundedHero of any unauthorized access or suspicious activities.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">4.2 Prohibited Activities<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You agree not to engage in any activities that are illegal, unethical, or disruptive to the operation of the platform. Specifically, you will not:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Manipulate the Platform: Engage in any behavior that distorts or manipulates the simulated trading environment, including market manipulation or front-running strategies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Commit Fraud: Falsify trades or data to misrepresent your trading performance or to gain an unfair advantage.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Access Unauthorized Data: Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the platform, user data, or other restricted areas of the Service.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">4.3 Compliance with Platform Rules<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By using the platform, you agree to comply with all of FundedHero\u2019s platform rules, including ethical guidelines, risk management protocols, and trading strategies. Violations of these rules may result in immediate suspension or termination of your account and eligibility for payouts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ethical Guidelines: You agree to uphold the integrity of the platform and respect the educational intent behind the Service.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Risk Management: You agree to utilize sound risk management techniques when using the platform and follow any guidelines set by FundedHero for managing simulated funds.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>5. Liability, Disclaimers, and Limitations of Responsibility<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">5.1 No Financial Liability<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FundedHero assumes no liability for any direct or indirect financial loss, damages, or claims arising from your use of the platform. Simulated funds have no real-world monetary value and cannot be exchanged for actual money or assets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>No Guarantee of Real-World Trading Success: Participation in the platform does not guarantee success in real-world financial markets, and you should seek professional advice before making any real trading decisions.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">5.2 Limitation of Liability<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To the fullest extent permitted by law, FundedHero and its affiliates, employees, and agents shall not be held liable for:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Loss of Profit: Any loss of simulated or real-world profit arising from participation in the platform.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>System Failures: Any technical difficulties, failures, or interruptions in service that may affect the performance of the platform.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Errors in Data: Any inaccuracies or errors in the data provided by the platform, including but not limited to trade performance, statistics, and market simulations.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">5.3 No Guarantee of Performance<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FundedHero does not guarantee any specific performance outcome, success, or future trading results based on the use of the simulated trading platform. Performance in simulated trading is not indicative of real-world trading success.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>6. Privacy, Data Collection, and Security<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">6.1 Data Collection<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FundedHero collects personal data, such as your name, email address, IP address, and usage information to facilitate your use of the platform. We also collect data regarding your trading behavior and performance in the simulated environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Required Information: Providing accurate and complete personal information is necessary for account creation, payout processing, and communication with you.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">6.2 Data Use and Sharing<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We may use the collected data to improve our services, communicate with you about platform updates, and deliver personalized content. Your data may also be shared with trusted third-party service providers for payment processing and fraud detection.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Data Retention: We will retain your data only as long as necessary for the purposes outlined in this agreement or as required by law.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">6.3 Data Security<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or disclosure. However, you acknowledge that absolute security cannot be guaranteed and that data transmission over the internet inherently carries risks.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">6.4 User Consent to Data Usage<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By using the platform, you consent to the collection, processing, and sharing of your personal data as described in this section. You may review our Privacy Policy for more detailed information about how your data is handled.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>7. Dispute Resolution and Legal Process<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">7.1 Initial Dispute Resolution<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the event of any dispute or claim arising from or related to these Terms, the parties agree to first attempt to resolve the dispute through mediation before pursuing further legal action. Mediation will be conducted by a neutral third-party mediator, agreed upon by both parties.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">7.2 Binding Arbitration<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If the dispute cannot be resolved through mediation, the matter will proceed to binding arbitration in accordance with the rules of the American Arbitration Association (AAA). Arbitration shall take place in Pinella County, Florida, and the arbitrator\u2019s decision will be final and binding.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">7.3 Arbitration Fees and Costs<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The parties agree to share equally the costs of arbitration, unless otherwise ordered by the arbitrator. Each party shall bear its own legal costs and expenses associated with arbitration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>8. Miscellaneous Legal Provisions<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">8.1 Force Majeure<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Neither party shall be held liable for any failure to perform its obligations under these Terms due to events beyond its reasonable control, including but not limited to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Natural disasters (e.g., hurricanes, earthquakes).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Government regulations, changes, or restrictions.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Network or system failures, including internet outages.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Labor disputes, strikes, or civil unrest.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">8.2 Severability<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If any provision of these Terms is deemed invalid, illegal, or unenforceable by a court of competent jurisdiction, the remaining provisions shall remain in full force and effect. The parties agree that the unenforceable provision will be modified to reflect the intent of the original provision as closely as possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">8.3 Indemnification<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless FundedHero, its affiliates, officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any and all claims, damages, liabilities, losses, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising from:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Your use or misuse of the platform.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Any violation of these Terms.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Any third-party claims arising out of your activities.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>9. Contact Information<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For any questions or concerns regarding these Terms, please contact us at:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Trade@fundedhero.com\">Trade@fundedhero.com<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Acknowledgment<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By creating an account and using the platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Effective Date: 05\/01\/2025 Last Updated: 05\/01\/2025 Company: FundedHero Website: Fundedhero.com 1. General Information, Acknowledgment, and Acceptance of Terms 1.1 Introduction to Services Welcome to FundedHero. We provide a comprehensive simulated trading platform designed specifically to help individuals hone their trading skills in a risk-free environment. By accessing, using, or subscribing to the platform, you agree to comply with and be &#8230; <a title=\"Terms and Conditions of Service\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/fundedherofutures.com\/terms-and-conditions\/\" aria-label=\"Read more about Terms and Conditions of Service\">Read more<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3904","page","type-page","status-publish"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v25.4 (Yoast SEO v28.1) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Terms and Conditions of Service - FundedHero Futures<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/fundedherofutures.com\/terms-and-conditions\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Terms and Conditions